    },
    {
      "text": "A speaker sighs that Green Ant Ascetic’s enslavement path inheritance is going to a dragonman.",
      "chapters": [
        1830
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Army ant is the true inheritance of Green Ant Ascetic. After Wu Shuai inherits it he makes good use of it as his main offensive method; once the ants grow to a certain number they have terrifying might and one can fight a group of rank eight Gu Immortals alone.",
      "chapters": [
        1848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "army-ant-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_green_ant_ascetic",
        "char_wu_shuai",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Green Ant’s will asks whether Zui Xian Weng is willing to oppose Fang Yuan for this true inheritance. The inheritance contains Green Ant Ascetic’s enslavement path inheritance as well as Wine Fairy’s food path true inheritance. The enslavement path true inheritance is not highly valuable to Zui Xian Weng, but Wine Fairy’s true inheritance is. Qin Ding Ling tells him that since he had the fortune to find this inheritance, it belongs to him.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paired-with-wine-fairy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zui_xian_weng",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "inh_wine_fairy_true_inheritance",
        "char_wine_fairy",
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Zui Xian Weng inherits Green Ant Ascetic and Wine Fairy’s true inheritance in Central Continent, Qin Ding Ling silently persuades him to be a chess piece. Earlier, while the Righteous Qi Alliance wanted to invite him over an ant plague, he had already gone to Central Continent and was secretly searching for Green Ant’s true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
